## Proposed Task Schema: "PO Review"

### What the reviewer will see (read-only context fields)

| Field | ID | Type | Label |
|---|---|---|---|
| PO Number | `poNumber` | string | "PO Number" |
| Vendor Name | `vendorName` | string | "Vendor Name" |
| Total Amount | `totalAmount` | number | "Total Amount ($)" |

These will be pre-populated from a mock data script upstream.

---

### What the reviewer fills in

| Field | ID | Type | Label | Required |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Notes | `notes` | string | "Notes" | No (optional) |

---

### Action buttons (outcomes)

- ✅ **Approve**
- ❌ **Reject**

Which button is clicked is captured in `$vars.poReview1.status` — the flow will branch on `"Approve"` vs `"Reject"`.

---

## Proposed Flow Structure

```
Manual Trigger
      ↓
Mock PO Data (script — sets poNumber, vendorName, totalAmount)
      ↓
PO Review (HITL — QuickForm)
      ↓
   [Branch on status]
   ├── "Approve" → Log Approval (script) → End
   └── "Reject"  → End
```

---

